1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,940
I couldn't stop the cancer or the things that chemo took

2
00:00:03,940 --> 00:00:07,460
But I could choose the face I wore and every way I'd look

3
00:00:07,460 --> 00:00:11,460
'Cause I'd hurt worse watching someone that I love go through the same

4
00:00:11,460 --> 00:00:15,220
So I kept the fear behind my eyes, and I held on to the pain

5
00:00:15,220 --> 00:00:18,500
Every time they looked at me, I gave them calm instead of fear

6
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:22,420
That was the only wheel I had, so that's the one I steered

7
00:00:22,420 --> 00:00:26,260
Life is ten percent what lands on your plate

8
00:00:26,260 --> 00:00:28,980
Ninety's how you hold the weight

9
00:00:28,980 --> 00:00:32,660
From where you stand, it's a nine

10
00:00:32,660 --> 00:00:35,700
From where I stand, it's a six

11
00:00:36,740 --> 00:00:39,940
Some storms you just can't stop

12
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:44,340
Some things you just can't fix

13
00:00:44,340 --> 00:00:47,460
I can't control the weather

14
00:00:47,460 --> 00:00:51,380
But I can choose the way I stand

15
00:00:51,540 --> 00:00:55,140
And from where I stand today

16
00:00:55,140 --> 00:01:00,100
Still standing, here I am
